# A. Authentication & Access

---

## A1. Register Account Intent

- Actor: New user
- Goal: Begin onboarding
- Preconditions: None
- Steps: Open registration → Choose business type → Enter basic identity → Create credentials
- Entities: User (Invited/Active pending), Business (Draft Registration)
- Success: Account created; verification path available
- Failures: Duplicate phone/email; invalid inputs

## A2. Login

- Actor: Existing user
- Goal: Access platform
- Preconditions: Active user credentials
- Steps: Enter credentials → Authenticate → Land in role home
- Success: Session established
- Failures: Wrong credentials; suspended user; deactivated user

## A3. Logout

- Actor: Logged-in user
- Goal: End session
- Steps: Choose logout → Session ended
- Success: User logged out

## A4. Forgot Password

- Actor: Existing user
- Goal: Regain access
- Steps: Request reset → Verify identity → Set new password → Login
- Success: Password updated
- Failures: Invalid identity proof; expired reset

## A5. Reset Password While Logged In

- Actor: Logged-in user
- Goal: Change password
- Steps: Enter current password → Enter new password → Confirm
- Success: Password changed
- Failures: Current password mismatch; weak password

## A6. First Login After Invite

- Actor: Invited staff
- Goal: Activate membership
- Preconditions: Valid invite
- Steps: Open invite → Set credentials/profile → Enter business
- Success: User Active
- Failures: Expired invite; revoked invite

## A7. Session Timeout Re-Login

- Actor: Any user
- Goal: Resume work securely
- Steps: Timeout → Re-authenticate → Resume permitted context
- Success: Secure re-entry
- Failures: Account suspended during timeout

