# B. Registration & Verification

---

## B1. Pharmacy Registration

- Actor: Pharmacy owner
- Goal: Create pharmacy business
- Steps: Choose Pharmacy → Enter business details → Submit required fields → Create business
- Entities: Business, User, Business Verification (Not Started/Submitted path)
- Success: Draft/Pending verification business exists

## B2. Stockist Registration

- Actor: Stockist owner
- Goal: Create stockist business
- Same pattern as B1 with Business Type = Stockist

## B3. Submit Verification Documents

- Actor: Business owner
- Goal: Request approval to trade
- Preconditions: Business registered
- Steps: Upload licenses/GST/docs → Submit
- Entities: Business Verification → Submitted
- Success: Under review queue
- Failures: Missing required docs; invalid format

## B4. Admin Reviews Verification

- Actor: Platform Administrator
- Goal: Decide eligibility
- Steps: Open application → Review docs → Approve / Reject / Request documents
- Success: Business verified or correction requested/rejected

## B5. Admin Approves Business

- Steps: Approve → Business Verification = Approved → Business can trade (subject to active status)
- Notifications: Business notified

## B6. Admin Rejects Business

- Steps: Reject with reason → Business cannot trade → Business may reapply per rules

## B7. Admin Requests Document Corrections

- Steps: Request specific docs → Business status Documents Requested → Business resubmits

## B8. Business Resubmits Documents

- Preconditions: Documents Requested or Rejected with resubmit allowed
- Steps: Upload corrections → Resubmit → Back to Under Review

## B9. View Verification Status

- Actor: Business user
- Goal: Know whether trading is allowed
- Success: Clear status and required actions shown

